Description: V-Sync, quit with Escape or window close, fullscreen option
 Without V-Sync the intro draws more than 1000 frames per second, and the
 pong part, which moves one step per frame, lasts a fraction of a second.
 sdl12-compat syncs SDL_Flip() to the vertical blank when
 SDL12COMPAT_SYNC_TO_VBLANK is set, so it is set before SDL_SetVideoMode()
 (an existing value from the environment is kept).
 .
 The intro only handled key presses, one event per frame, to skip a part:
 all pending events are now read, Escape or closing the window quits.
 .
 Also: --fullscreen option (with hidden cursor), window title, error message
 when the video mode cannot be set, exit status 0 at the end, missing return
 value in Q().
